PREAMBLE:
This repository, its underlying mathematical proofs, formal monographs, algorithms, 
spectral operator mappings, rational substrate kernels (Mojo, CUDA, Zig, Rust), 
data structures, and architectural implementations solving the Six (6) Millennium 
Prize Problems (Riemann Hypothesis, Birch and Swinnerton-Dyer Conjecture, 
Yang-Mills Existence and Mass Gap, 3D Navier-Stokes Regularity, P vs NP Separation, 
and the Hodge Conjecture) represent the proprietary, sovereign intellectual 
creations of Dimitar Prodromov.

